OL,3,ABurnham defends inviting influencers
OL,4,Ainto No 10 in PMQs row with Badenoch
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has defended his use of
OL,7,Fsocial media influencers to get the
OL,8,Fgovernment's message across to young
OL,9,Fpeople in angry exchanges with Kemi
OL,10,FBadenoch at Prime Minister's Questions.
OL,12,FThe Conservative leader called on the
OL,13,Fprime minister to apologise for
OL,14,F"debasing his office" by allowing a
OL,15,Fcontent creator to record a video on
OL,16,Fthe steps of Number 10, which included
OL,17,F"vile" and "obscene" comments about
OL,18,Fwomen.
OL,20,FBurnham said the video had been taken
OL,21,Fdown and its creator had "rightly
OL,22,Fapologised" for it.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
